# Custom Muse Glimmer configuration for medmcp tool-calling.
#
# Muse Glimmer 30B is Meta's open agentic model (Apache 2.0), built for local
# tool use; it also carries a perception encoder, so it can read images.
#
# num_ctx 131072; keeps room for MCP tool schemas (~1500 tokens), the system prompt, and long multi-turn dialogue.
#
# Temperature must match the [[models]] entry in the vibe config, which sends it
# on every request and would otherwise override whatever is set here. 0.3 is
# deliberate: the model is choosing tool arguments and file paths, where
# creativity is a defect. This PARAMETER still governs calls that send no
# temperature of their own — the explain and distill passes.
# repeat_penalty + repeat_last_n guard against open-ended generation loops.
#
# Needs Ollama >= 0.32.15: 0.32.9 was the first build to accept the manifest
# (older ones reject it with a 412), and 0.32.15 the first where a tool-call
# parser error mid-stream no longer wedges the chat.
#
# Build with:
#   ollama create muse-medmcp -f Modelfile.muse
FROM muse-glimmer:30b
PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER repeat_last_n 64
